# Codecastic GH - Enterprise Database Configuration (MariaDB / MySQL)
# -------------------------------------------------------------------
# To connect Codecastic GH to MariaDB on cPanel or your VPS:
# 1. Create a MySQL/MariaDB database and user in cPanel ("MySQL Databases" or "MySQL Database Wizard").
# 2. Assign the user to the database with ALL PRIVILEGES.
# 3. Rename this file to .env in your application root, or set these Environment Variables
#    directly in cPanel "Setup Node.js App".

DB_HOST=localhost
DB_NAME=yourcpaneluser_codecastic
DB_USER=yourcpaneluser_dbuser
DB_PASSWORD=YourStrongPasswordHere!
DB_PORT=3306
